    "text": "The pressure is constant and equal to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Also the process is a single step <br/>Therefore, it is a straight line parallel to volume axis and has a value of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Also, work done <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>ex</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Area under theP−Vcurve."
